<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Drawn by Him each morning at His dear face we gaze,</l><l>Sitting at His feet each day His speaking we heed,</l><l>Then in Him we’re living, Him to others shining,</l><l>Bearing fruit we’re filled with joy indeed!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
